# ibara360 1.00: only what the four 1.00 .xex files build from (ibara.xex, ibarablk.xex, ibaraarr.xex and the launcher
# ibara360.xex, host/xsdk/ibara360), plus the PS2 disc extractor's sources. Everything is ignored, then each build input
# is let back in by name. The list is the ninja deps of the build that made 1.00 (volume xsdk-t118; the launcher is unchanged since test 116), plus CMakeLists.txt,
# build.sh, the shaders, the scripts CMake runs (tools/achieve) and the licence files. Build: see README.md.
# Earlier versions are in the history (0.82 = tag v0.82, test 38's libxenon ELF build = commit b30daea).
*
!*/
/ref/
!/.gitignore
